[
  {
    "text": "We accept privacy policies all the",
    "start": 0.19,
    "end": 2.62
  },
  {
    "text": "time, usually without reading them.",
    "start": 2.49,
    "end": 4.62
  },
  {
    "text": "Even a summary may not tell",
    "start": 4.55,
    "end": 5.98
  },
  {
    "text": "me what matters for my situation,",
    "start": 5.8500000000000005,
    "end": 7.5600000000000005
  },
  {
    "text": "what the document leaves unclear, or",
    "start": 7.73,
    "end": 9.7
  },
  {
    "text": "what I can actually do next.",
    "start": 9.569999999999999,
    "end": 11.040000000000001
  },
  {
    "text": "I built P7 to turn that",
    "start": 11.569999999999999,
    "end": 13.38
  },
  {
    "text": "difficult consent decision into evidence,",
    "start": 13.25,
    "end": 15.18
  },
  {
    "text": "possible impact, and concrete actions in",
    "start": 15.649999999999999,
    "end": 17.799999999999997
  },
  {
    "text": "Spanish and English.",
    "start": 17.669999999999998,
    "end": 18.759999999999998
  },
  {
    "text": "The user pays to privacy policy.",
    "start": 20.25,
    "end": 22.18
  },
  {
    "text": "P7 never needs account access or",
    "start": 22.45,
    "end": 24.4
  },
  {
    "text": "browsing history.",
    "start": 24.27,
    "end": 25.2
  },
  {
    "text": "I load the fictional example,",
    "start": 25.57,
    "end": 27.0
  },
  {
    "text": "choose journalist,",
    "start": 27.07,
    "end": 27.86
  },
  {
    "text": "and press analyze policy.",
    "start": 27.93,
    "end": 29.299999999999997
  },
  {
    "text": "That profile gives more weight to",
    "start": 29.169999999999998,
    "end": 31.299999999999997
  },
  {
    "text": "location,",
    "start": 31.169999999999998,
    "end": 31.759999999999998
  },
  {
    "text": "contacts, and third party sharing.",
    "start": 31.99,
    "end": 33.559999999999995
  },
  {
    "text": "The text is processed locally and",
    "start": 33.830000000000005,
    "end": 35.58
  },
  {
    "text": "is not intentionally stored.",
    "start": 35.45,
    "end": 37.0
  },
  {
    "text": "This index is not invented directly",
    "start": 38.39,
    "end": 40.36
  },
  {
    "text": "by the language model.",
    "start": 40.230000000000004,
    "end": 41.4
  },
  {
    "text": "The model identifies candidate practices.",
    "start": 41.53,
    "end": 43.66
  },
  {
    "text": "The go -back end verifies the",
    "start": 44.07,
    "end": 45.78
  },
  {
    "text": "evidence and applies transparent profile weights.",
    "start": 45.650000000000006,
    "end": 47.96
  },
  {
    "text": "The SHA 256 value identifies the",
    "start": 48.25,
    "end": 51.62
  },
  {
    "text": "exact normalized document used for this",
    "start": 51.49,
    "end": 53.42
  },
  {
    "text": "report.",
    "start": 53.290000000000006,
    "end": 53.739999999999995
  },
  {
    "text": "The map shows the path declared",
    "start": 53.99,
    "end": 55.4
  },
  {
    "text": "in the policy.",
    "start": 55.27,
    "end": 56.059999999999995
  },
  {
    "text": "It does not claim to observe",
    "start": 55.93,
    "end": 57.76
  },
  {
    "text": "real network traffic.",
    "start": 57.63,
    "end": 59.18
  },
  {
    "text": "Every confirmed finding returns to an",
    "start": 60.290000000000006,
    "end": 62.32
  },
  {
    "text": "exact clause.",
    "start": 62.190000000000005,
    "end": 63.04
  },
  {
    "text": "In this run, P7 reports location,",
    "start": 63.31,
    "end": 65.48
  },
  {
    "text": "third party sharing,",
    "start": 65.57000000000001,
    "end": 66.6
  },
  {
    "text": "personalized advertising,",
    "start": 67.13000000000001,
    "end": 67.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and AI training, but not contacts.",
    "start": 67.89,
    "end": 69.78
  },
  {
    "text": "The stricter definition requires explicit device",
    "start": 70.15,
    "end": 72.64
  },
  {
    "text": "address book access.",
    "start": 72.51,
    "end": 73.6
  },
  {
    "text": "If a quote is absent from",
    "start": 73.81,
    "end": 75.12
  },
  {
    "text": "its reference clause, go rejects it.",
    "start": 74.99000000000001,
    "end": 76.98
  },
  {
    "text": "Missing information is a question not",
    "start": 77.11,
    "end": 79.14
  },
  {
    "text": "proof of a violation.",
    "start": 79.01,
    "end": 80.1
  },
  {
    "text": "The next section translates findings into",
    "start": 81.05,
    "end": 83.78
  },
  {
    "text": "possible scenarios without presenting them as",
    "start": 83.65,
    "end": 85.92
  },
  {
    "text": "facts.",
    "start": 85.79,
    "end": 86.42
  },
  {
    "text": "Location could reveal routines.",
    "start": 87.09,
    "end": 88.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Shared activity may shape advertising and",
    "start": 89.05,
    "end": 91.0
  },
  {
    "text": "submitted content may enter AI improvement.",
    "start": 90.87,
    "end": 92.92
  },
  {
    "text": "The action plan makes those concerns",
    "start": 93.27,
    "end": 94.84
  },
  {
    "text": "practical,",
    "start": 94.71000000000001,
    "end": 95.42
  },
  {
    "text": "restrict location,",
    "start": 95.79,
    "end": 96.72
  },
  {
    "text": "review partner sharing, and add controls,",
    "start": 97.09,
    "end": 98.78
  },
  {
    "text": "and avoid sensitive content when AI",
    "start": 98.95,
    "end": 100.98
  },
  {
    "text": "training cannot be disabled.",
    "start": 100.85000000000001,
    "end": 102.26
  },
  {
    "text": "The evidence stays the same, but",
    "start": 103.59,
    "end": 105.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the priority changes.",
    "start": 105.19,
    "end": 106.32
  },
  {
    "text": "I select general and press analyze",
    "start": 106.49000000000001,
    "end": 108.38
  },
  {
    "text": "again. The same four findings remain",
    "start": 108.25,
    "end": 110.6
  },
  {
    "text": "visible while the index moves from",
    "start": 110.47,
    "end": 112.26
  },
  {
    "text": "97 for journalists to 80 for",
    "start": 112.13000000000001,
    "end": 114.3
  },
  {
    "text": "general.",
    "start": 114.17,
    "end": 114.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Those profile weights are transparent and",
    "start": 115.19,
    "end": 117.26
  },
  {
    "text": "reproducible.",
    "start": 117.13000000000001,
    "end": 117.84
  },
  {
    "text": "The model cannot alter them.",
    "start": 118.05,
    "end": 120.06
  },
  {
    "text": "The executable product uses QN3,",
    "start": 120.75,
    "end": 123.32
  },
  {
    "text": "4 billion instruct through local alama.",
    "start": 123.47,
    "end": 125.58
  },
  {
    "text": "It performs focus semantic classification and",
    "start": 125.91,
    "end": 128.60000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "returns structured candidates.",
    "start": 128.47,
    "end": 129.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Go rejects unsupported categories or fabricated",
    "start": 130.58999999999997,
    "end": 133.38000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "evidence removes duplicates and calculates the",
    "start": 133.25,
    "end": 136.16000000000003
  },
  {
    "text": "index. Chat GPT and Codex also",
    "start": 136.03,
    "end": 139.04000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "helped with research, scope,",
    "start": 138.91,
    "end": 140.56
  },
  {
    "text": "architecture,",
    "start": 141.07,
    "end": 141.20000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "code, design,",
    "start": 141.32999999999998,
    "end": 142.28
  },
  {
    "text": "tests, and documentation.",
    "start": 142.58999999999997,
    "end": 143.64000000000001
  },
  {
    "text": "I reviewed and tested that work",
    "start": 144.29,
    "end": 145.92000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "and I disclosed both kinds of",
    "start": 145.79,
    "end": 147.4
  },
  {
    "text": "AI assistance.",
    "start": 147.26999999999998,
    "end": 148.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Those capabilities are the seven pillars",
    "start": 149.73,
    "end": 151.68
  },
  {
    "text": "behind the name P7.",
    "start": 151.54999999999998,
    "end": 152.98000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "Data mapping,",
    "start": 153.35,
    "end": 153.9
  },
  {
    "text": "personalized risk, gap detection,",
    "start": 154.48999999999998,
    "end": 155.84
  },
  {
    "text": "verifiable evidence,",
    "start": 156.07,
    "end": 156.98000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "impact simulation,",
    "start": 157.31,
    "end": 157.92000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "smart consent,",
    "start": 157.98999999999998,
    "end": 158.70000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "and privacy for everyone.",
    "start": 158.75,
    "end": 160.02
  },
  {
    "text": "The final pillar matters.",
    "start": 160.51,
    "end": 161.70000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "P7 works in English and Spanish,",
    "start": 161.57,
    "end": 164.10000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "using plain language explanations designed to",
    "start": 164.32999999999998,
    "end": 166.60000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "reach people beyond legal and technical",
    "start": 166.47,
    "end": 168.46
  },
  {
    "text": "audiences,",
    "start": 168.32999999999998,
    "end": 169.06
  },
  {
    "text": "including communities in Latin America.",
    "start": 169.39,
    "end": 171.20000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "My background gave me more confidence",
    "start": 172.70999999999998,
    "end": 174.60000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "in backend and cybersecurity than an",
    "start": 174.47,
    "end": 176.84
  },
  {
    "text": "explainable AI.",
    "start": 176.70999999999998,
    "end": 177.82000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "Early on, the model treated 12",
    "start": 178.20999999999998,
    "end": 179.96
  },
  {
    "text": "denial clauses as if those practices",
    "start": 179.82999999999998,
    "end": 181.84
  },
  {
    "text": "happened.",
    "start": 181.70999999999998,
    "end": 182.34
  },
  {
    "text": "The answer looked confident,",
    "start": 182.58999999999997,
    "end": 183.92000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "but it was wrong.",
    "start": 184.08999999999997,
    "end": 184.94000000000003
  },
  {
    "text": "In the latest revised complete policy",
    "start": 184.81,
    "end": 187.3
  },
  {
    "text": "evaluation,",
    "start": 187.17,
    "end": 188.04000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "precision reached 87 .5 % and",
    "start": 188.29,
    "end": 190.82000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "recalled 70 % yet none of",
    "start": 190.69,
    "end": 192.82000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "the four localized pages had a",
    "start": 192.69,
    "end": 194.54000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "perfect category set.",
    "start": 194.41,
    "end": 195.72
  },
  {
    "text": "I learned that a polished demo",
    "start": 196.41,
    "end": 197.76000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "proves functionality,",
    "start": 197.63,
    "end": 198.70000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "not reliability,",
    "start": 198.98999999999998,
    "end": 199.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and that even exact evidence still",
    "start": 200.17,
    "end": 202.06
  },
  {
    "text": "needs human interpretation.",
    "start": 201.92999999999998,
    "end": 203.34
  },
  {
    "text": "No application code existed before this",
    "start": 205.01,
    "end": 207.24
  },
  {
    "text": "hackathon.",
    "start": 207.10999999999999,
    "end": 207.66000000000003
  },
  {
    "text": "P7 was created during the event",
    "start": 208.08999999999997,
    "end": 209.64000000000001
  },
  {
    "text": "using credited open source tools and",
    "start": 209.51,
    "end": 211.44000000000003
  },
  {
    "text": "models. Next, I would add independent",
    "start": 211.31,
    "end": 213.64000000000001
  },
  {
    "text": "label review,",
    "start": 213.51,
    "end": 214.46
  },
  {
    "text": "user comprehension testing,",
    "start": 214.57,
    "end": 215.76000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "policy version comparison,",
    "start": 216.10999999999999,
    "end": 217.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and verified sources for Latin America.",
    "start": 217.25,
    "end": 219.20000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "P7 does not replace legal advice.",
    "start": 219.60999999999999,
    "end": 221.56
  },
  {
    "text": "It gives people a clearer first",
    "start": 221.75,
    "end": 223.20000000000002
  },
  {
    "text": "reading before they accept evidence before",
    "start": 223.07,
    "end": 225.46
  },
  {
